<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan National Development shows profit.</title>
<headline>Pakistan National Development shows profit.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for 18 months ended June 30, 1996 against 12 months ended Dec 31, 1994 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	 266 vs 187</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	  211 vs 157</p>
<p>    Dividend		     30 vs  15 pct per five-rupee share</p>
<p>    Bonus stock		 nil vs  25 pct</p>
<p>    Right issue		 nil vs  10 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - National Development Leasing Corp changed its financial year to July-June from Jan-Dec. Book closure Nov 24 to Dec 8. AGM on Dec 5.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
